  "details": "Please point the parameter of start_url of \"https://assets.vrchat.com/www/favicons/site.webmanifest\" to `https://vrchat.com/home` rather than `https://vrchat.com`. \n\nBecause of the root level redirect of `vrchat.com` to `hello.vrchat.com`, creating a home screen shortcut on iOS will only ever open hello.vrchat.com, rather than the logged in homepage at https://vrchat.com/home.\n\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Manifest/start_url\n\nBy making this change, those that create a home screen shortcut while on their dashboard should load into the correct area. You already have logic that will send them to the login page if they aren't logged in, so this should function as expected.",
